			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Finalize Mountain notification relay delegation\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to cd31d1dc, completing the notification delegation refactor in Mountain.\n\nMountain collapses the remaining pure-relay notification handlers in `MountainVinegRPCService` to single-line delegations of `::Vine::Server::Notification::Support::RelayToSky::Fn`. Extension lifecycle, webview lifecycle, language settings, workspace edits, window commands, tree refresh, progress lifecycle, and output channel operations now all route through the canonical Vine relay with `sky://` addressing. Add `dev_log!` instrumentation at dispatch sites for diagnostic observability.\n\nMountain's notification surface is now a pure routing table. Vine remains the single source of truth for all Cocoon→Sky IPC paths, while specialized handlers requiring coalescing, transformation, or state management remain in Mountain.",
			"SHA": "220b3d69ab790210fb1d942000c31651cc8502d7"
		},
